WEBVTT

00:01:37.710 --> 00:01:44.260
It was sent to be broken down. I don't want
anyone else becoming obsessed with it.

00:01:44.260 --> 00:01:48.390
So... just let me get rid of it.

00:01:52.810 --> 00:01:55.390
It's better this way.

00:02:00.950 --> 00:02:06.030
Let this be the end of it. The Devil Z is dead.

00:02:14.250 --> 00:02:19.500
<i>Wangan's Ghost</i>

00:02:19.920 --> 00:02:22.110
It shouldn't take any longer than an hour.

00:02:22.110 --> 00:02:22.730
Ok.

00:02:24.370 --> 00:02:28.700
They've got Harada-kun working as a delivery boy at the moment.

00:02:28.700 --> 00:02:30.000
Delivery boy?

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:32.380
I met him on the street yesterday.

00:02:32.380 --> 00:02:35.780
He looked ok. He said to say "Hi" to you.

00:02:37.270 --> 00:02:38.140
<i>You're quitting?</i>

00:02:38.370 --> 00:02:40.780
<i>Yeah, I know it's a bit sudden.</i>

00:02:40.780 --> 00:02:43.240
<i>I've just told the boss.</i>

00:02:43.240 --> 00:02:46.400
<i>Seriously, Harada? What the hell are you gonna do?</i>

00:02:46.400 --> 00:02:51.270
<i>I need the speed of the wind and lightning. I've gotta have it...</i>

00:02:51.270 --> 00:02:53.820
<i>You want that Z, don't you?</i>

00:02:53.820 --> 00:02:55.360
<i>Thanks for looking out for me all this time.</i>

00:02:58.440 --> 00:03:02.610
That Z is dead! You've gotta stop thinking about it!

00:03:06.340 --> 00:03:07.580
What are you thinking about?

00:03:10.080 --> 00:03:11.110
Nothing...

00:03:12.190 --> 00:03:14.200
Do you want a drink? I'll go get us some.

00:03:14.200 --> 00:03:16.070
I'd love a green tea.

00:03:16.070 --> 00:03:17.180
Hiramoto-san?

00:03:17.180 --> 00:03:18.380
Hiramoto and Megumi-san...

00:03:18.960 --> 00:03:19.980
This way.

00:03:19.980 --> 00:03:20.790
Alright!

00:03:21.770 --> 00:03:23.410
See you in a bit.

00:03:46.200 --> 00:03:48.440
Is it really over?

00:03:49.790 --> 00:03:53.570
We're never gonna see that Z on Wangan again.

00:03:53.570 --> 00:03:55.230
Do you really think so?

00:03:55.230 --> 00:03:55.710
Huh?

00:03:55.950 --> 00:03:59.220
Is the Devil Z really just scrap metal now?

00:04:00.740 --> 00:04:02.880
I don't think so.

00:04:02.880 --> 00:04:04.220
Why?

00:04:04.590 --> 00:04:11.150
I can't see the Z's legend on Wangan ending like this.

00:04:22.630 --> 00:04:25.420
Sugita-san, can you put it over there, please?

00:04:25.420 --> 00:04:27.050
Ok.

00:04:27.820 --> 00:04:30.730
Hey, it's been a while.

00:04:30.730 --> 00:04:32.540
Kitami?

00:04:32.880 --> 00:04:34.540
Introduce customers to you?

00:04:34.840 --> 00:04:37.960
I don't think we have any customers we can introduce to you.

00:04:37.960 --> 00:04:40.920
Not the customers of your workshop, number 2...

00:04:40.920 --> 00:04:42.800
The customers of Uncle Sugita...

00:04:43.460 --> 00:04:45.610
I need to make some money.

00:04:45.620 --> 00:04:50.020
I've borrowed a car I tuned a while back. Come take a look.

00:04:50.020 --> 00:04:51.880
It's a really nice car now.

00:04:51.880 --> 00:04:53.940
I can do another tune-up like this in no time at all.

00:04:54.690 --> 00:04:56.080
Ok.

00:04:56.080 --> 00:04:58.230
Hiramoto, take it for a ride.

00:05:21.730 --> 00:05:23.330
<i>This feeling...</i>

00:05:24.380 --> 00:05:27.050
<i>This... this feels incredible.</i>

00:05:28.190 --> 00:05:31.640
<i>Amazing. I'd forgotten all about it.</i>

00:05:33.940 --> 00:05:35.050
What do you think?

00:05:35.050 --> 00:05:38.020
This is wonderful.

00:05:38.020 --> 00:05:43.330
This is the real deal. This is how a car should be.

00:05:44.650 --> 00:05:47.660
So, regular Ferrari's are not good enough then?

00:05:47.930 --> 00:05:49.970
No, it's not that.

00:05:49.970 --> 00:05:53.970
They're like top-notch race cars, technically great...

00:05:53.970 --> 00:05:56.380
but to be a real dragon...

00:05:56.390 --> 00:06:01.470
it's as if you've taken a scale from one and cloned it!

00:06:03.330 --> 00:06:07.230
I don't think that our customers could afford this kind of thing...

00:06:07.230 --> 00:06:08.460
None at all?

00:06:08.460 --> 00:06:13.780
Not really. To push the horsepower up by 100...

00:06:13.780 --> 00:06:17.540
I can probably think of three.

00:06:17.540 --> 00:06:21.440
No matter who they are, I can do whatever they want.

00:06:21.440 --> 00:06:24.170
I really need the money at the moment.

00:06:24.170 --> 00:06:27.720
Is it... because you wanna rebuild that Z?

00:06:33.910 --> 00:06:36.830
You saw it at my garage the other day, right?

00:06:37.890 --> 00:06:39.340
You saw me?

00:06:41.610 --> 00:06:42.380
Yeah...

00:06:42.860 --> 00:06:46.400
You said you were gonna break it down.

00:06:46.400 --> 00:06:48.900
I didn't think that was the real story, Kitami-san.

00:06:49.660 --> 00:06:51.470
I hear it...

00:06:52.000 --> 00:06:56.150
I hear its voice calling me every night.

00:06:57.390 --> 00:07:00.290
It's really very special.

00:07:00.290 --> 00:07:03.560
I don't understand it... and I'm the guy who tuned it.

00:07:05.350 --> 00:07:07.570
Wanna drive it?

00:07:09.720 --> 00:07:10.620
No...

00:07:11.140 --> 00:07:17.530
Yeah... you wanna tune a car to beat the Devil Z, don't you?

00:07:17.530 --> 00:07:20.290
I've been a mechanic for 12 years now.

00:07:20.290 --> 00:07:24.090
I quit high school at 16, started with
this company and I'm still there.

00:07:25.170 --> 00:07:30.550
My first car was an S130 that I got from
a garage that wanted it broken down.

00:07:31.110 --> 00:07:35.230
I got to tune some rotaries form FJ to VG.

00:07:35.230 --> 00:07:39.060
But it was the L-Series I liked the most, so back to the S130.

00:07:39.380 --> 00:07:42.310
How close could I get to my dream?

00:07:42.310 --> 00:07:45.820
Countless times the engine got burnt
out, but I'd spend all night fixing it.

00:07:46.590 --> 00:07:50.440
In the end, I realized I needed something stronger.

00:07:50.440 --> 00:07:53.630
What I needed was a real dragon.

00:07:54.620 --> 00:07:56.400
I started getting badly into debt.

00:07:56.980 --> 00:08:01.100
Even my girlfriend had to get a job in the Roppongi district.

00:08:01.700 --> 00:08:04.850
Then, she had a miscarriage...

00:08:05.300 --> 00:08:09.140
After that, I gave up my dream to own a car.

00:08:11.560 --> 00:08:13.350
But so what?

00:08:13.740 --> 00:08:17.120
It doesn't matter how many reasons you have.
If you can't do it, you can't do it.

00:08:17.130 --> 00:08:21.860
You have seen the Devil Z.

00:08:23.130 --> 00:08:26.250
You'll have to go back to racing now.

00:08:27.210 --> 00:08:32.360
Hello there, excuse me... I am Hiramoto's wife.

00:08:32.360 --> 00:08:35.720
<i>I'm sorry but, Hiramoto-san left quite some time ago.</i>

00:08:35.720 --> 00:08:39.090
Ah, really? Sorry to bother you.

00:08:52.090 --> 00:08:54.590
Welcome! Are you looking for an R?

00:08:54.900 --> 00:08:56.750
No, I'm just having a look around.

00:08:56.750 --> 00:08:59.830
Just looking around? It's no problem.

00:08:59.830 --> 00:09:04.750
Have a good look, the R is a great car.

00:09:11.540 --> 00:09:14.370
Look, that's a superb engine there, eh?

00:09:14.370 --> 00:09:17.550
3.15 million is extremely cheap for this car.

00:09:19.360 --> 00:09:25.510
<i>Ta-da! Our savings have finally reached 4 million!</i>

00:09:25.510 --> 00:09:28.250
<i>You'll have to go back to racing again now.</i>

00:09:36.500 --> 00:09:37.570
Please.

00:09:37.570 --> 00:09:39.220
Ok, no problem

00:09:39.220 --> 00:09:42.110
I want to buy a new one...

00:09:42.110 --> 00:09:44.340
But I think I'll let you take care of it.

00:09:44.340 --> 00:09:45.800
Thank you very much.

00:09:46.260 --> 00:09:46.880
Later.

00:09:50.490 --> 00:09:54.730
Hiramoto, are you gonna sen this one to Kitami?

00:09:54.730 --> 00:09:57.700
Yeah, I think it'd be perfect for what this customer wants.

00:09:57.700 --> 00:09:58.750
But what about the service records?

00:09:58.750 --> 00:09:59.700
It's sorted.

00:10:01.990 --> 00:10:03.130
Hiramoto?

00:10:03.130 --> 00:10:04.040
Yes?

00:10:04.040 --> 00:10:06.760
Kitami is indeed a dangerous tuner

00:10:06.760 --> 00:10:12.380
but he'll get the very most out of an engine.

00:10:12.380 --> 00:10:16.530
Even the boss used to have a Kitami tuned car.

00:10:16.530 --> 00:10:17.980
The boss?

00:10:28.310 --> 00:10:29.470
Kitami-san.

00:10:31.400 --> 00:10:33.530
Is there anybody here?

00:10:57.060 --> 00:11:00.810
<i>The engine is still alive after such a bad crash.</i>

00:11:02.180 --> 00:11:04.550
<i>It has a will of its own and wants to run.</i>

00:11:04.550 --> 00:11:06.270
<i>The Devil Z.</i>

00:11:07.400 --> 00:11:09.080
If it was you, what would you choose?

00:11:10.830 --> 00:11:11.610
Kitami-san.

00:11:11.610 --> 00:11:15.740
To resurrect the devil... what would you choose?

00:11:16.240 --> 00:11:20.840
I'd go for a BNR32 GT-R, definitely.

00:11:22.250 --> 00:11:26.540
And it'd be the most powerful R tuned by the greatest mechanic.

00:11:26.540 --> 00:11:28.920
Can it become your dragon?

00:11:35.580 --> 00:11:39.930
<i>It's been 3 years Koichi... you don't even have a car now.</i>

00:11:40.330 --> 00:11:45.940
<i>Soon we'll be able to go to Miyasaki
and you can open your own workshop.</i>

00:11:45.940 --> 00:11:50.320
<i>There'll be less chance for you to really show off your skills...</i>

00:11:51.410 --> 00:11:55.940
<i>But as long as the three of us can live happily together...</i>

00:12:07.330 --> 00:12:08.960
Koichi.

00:12:11.540 --> 00:12:14.960
Why are you walking so fast?

00:12:15.310 --> 00:12:18.080
I'm not as quick as I used to be.

00:12:18.080 --> 00:12:19.860
I-I'm sorry.

00:12:19.860 --> 00:12:24.770
Hey, Koichi... I think it's a waste of money
to buy a baby bed. Why not just rent one?

00:12:27.540 --> 00:12:29.280
Hey, are you listening?

00:12:30.360 --> 00:12:32.020
Huh? Yeah...

00:12:32.020 --> 00:12:33.690
What's the matter?

00:12:33.690 --> 00:12:35.360
You've been acting strange recently.

00:12:35.360 --> 00:12:36.850
No, it's nothing.

00:12:36.850 --> 00:12:40.280
Stop lying. You're looking at the savings book last night, right?

00:12:40.280 --> 00:12:41.590
Huh?

00:12:41.590 --> 00:12:44.190
Are you doing something behind my back?

00:12:44.190 --> 00:12:45.360
You'd better tell me right now.

00:12:50.770 --> 00:12:52.540
I can't race anymore, right?

00:12:52.870 --> 00:12:53.690
Eh?

00:12:53.690 --> 00:12:56.490
I can't use the money, can I?

00:12:57.180 --> 00:12:59.960
This is truly the last time.

00:12:59.960 --> 00:13:01.610
You want to buy a car?

00:13:03.450 --> 00:13:05.660
Our baby is due soon, Koichi!

00:13:05.660 --> 00:13:06.360
I'm sorry!

00:13:10.350 --> 00:13:14.790
Are you serious? How could you?

00:13:18.070 --> 00:13:22.120
How could you? How could...?

00:13:22.470 --> 00:13:27.150
These last three years... have I been living in a dream?

00:13:31.190 --> 00:13:35.430
I get it... Koichi, you just do whatever you want.

00:13:39.650 --> 00:13:44.050
But I can't live with you anymore....

00:13:44.060 --> 00:13:50.530
I'm not gonna wait up half the night worrying,
wondering if you'll ever come home from racing.

00:13:51.030 --> 00:13:51.980
Megumi...

00:13:51.990 --> 00:13:55.910
Nevermind... I'll just take care of the baby myself.

00:13:57.810 --> 00:13:59.400
I'm going back to Miyasaki.

00:14:00.740 --> 00:14:08.110
Koichi... you chose a car over the happiness of our child.

00:14:08.920 --> 00:14:11.200
I'm a coward, so...

00:14:12.120 --> 00:14:14.160
I can't live with you anymore!

00:14:30.230 --> 00:14:34.750
<i>Z, are you really gone?</i>

00:14:45.250 --> 00:14:47.610
<i>Catching up at this speed?</i>

00:14:47.610 --> 00:14:48.360
<i>That's fast!</i>

00:15:13.810 --> 00:15:15.810
<i>The Porsche...</i>

00:15:17.730 --> 00:15:22.820
<i>No, it can't be him... the BlackBird would've just caught me up.</i>

00:15:29.470 --> 00:15:31.110
Hey there, Akio-kun.

00:15:31.710 --> 00:15:32.560
Reina?

00:15:37.310 --> 00:15:38.130
Well...

00:15:38.440 --> 00:15:39.500
What?

00:15:39.500 --> 00:15:43.320
Have you come to see if I'm upset after losing the Z?

00:15:43.980 --> 00:15:45.820
Don't worry about me.

00:15:45.820 --> 00:15:47.600
No, not really.

00:15:48.040 --> 00:15:49.630
Then... why have you come after me?

00:15:50.020 --> 00:15:52.890
Well, I'm not sure if you'll get it or not

00:15:53.650 --> 00:15:55.850
It must be a misunderstanding

00:15:55.850 --> 00:15:57.680
No, definitely not...

00:15:58.520 --> 00:16:03.690
Especially when we're on Wangan, you understand me.

00:16:04.080 --> 00:16:09.160
That's what I thought anyway, when
we were chasing the Z on Wangan.

00:16:09.160 --> 00:16:10.700
Wangan...

00:16:10.700 --> 00:16:14.640
Tell me, do you want to run again on Wangan with me?

00:16:14.640 --> 00:16:15.720
Any time you want.

00:16:17.000 --> 00:16:18.050
Ok.

00:16:25.370 --> 00:16:26.610
Welcome home, Koichi.

00:16:33.640 --> 00:16:38.770
<i>I've lost the most important thing I had... just for a damn car.</i>

00:16:40.400 --> 00:16:42.860
<i>What an idiot I've been...</i>

00:16:45.060 --> 00:16:46.070
<i>But...</i>

00:16:50.580 --> 00:16:52.550
<i>Once I start racing again...</i>

00:16:53.500 --> 00:16:55.000
<i>I just can't stop!</i>

00:17:06.330 --> 00:17:13.440
<i>BNR32, I'm gonna turn you into a
real dragon with my own hands!</i>

00:17:14.410 --> 00:17:15.480
Matsu?

00:17:16.580 --> 00:17:17.990
Hiramoto?

00:17:17.990 --> 00:17:18.930
Yo.

00:17:18.930 --> 00:17:22.360
You're early. It was only half an hour ago.

00:17:23.180 --> 00:17:26.630
Did you just buy this? The normal one?

00:17:26.630 --> 00:17:30.790
Yeah, stock package with the higher spec wheels and tires.

00:17:30.790 --> 00:17:33.320
And the rubbish exhaust system.

00:17:33.320 --> 00:17:35.370
Yeah, this ain't no good!

00:17:35.370 --> 00:17:39.120
That's why I'm here. It's been three years, right?

00:17:39.450 --> 00:17:42.790
I get it... you wanna race on Wangan again, huh?

00:17:42.790 --> 00:17:46.510
Matsu, I'm gonna need one of your exhaust pipes.

00:17:46.510 --> 00:17:47.720
Please.

00:17:47.720 --> 00:17:52.010
Leave it to me... I'll build you a real special one.

00:17:53.560 --> 00:17:57.520
Eh, Hiramoto, I've not seen that look in your eyes for a long time.

00:17:57.520 --> 00:18:00.570
Ok, let's do it again!

00:18:04.670 --> 00:18:07.380
Hiramoto-san, there's someone here to see you.

00:18:08.820 --> 00:18:10.980
Excuse me, are you Hiramoto-san?

00:18:11.840 --> 00:18:12.480
Yes.

00:18:13.050 --> 00:18:16.090
<i>I've seen this guy before... at Kitami-san's garage.</i>

00:18:17.230 --> 00:18:18.440
<i>The black Turbo!</i>

00:18:18.920 --> 00:18:22.270
<i>Could it be... the BlackBird?</i>

00:18:22.930 --> 00:18:27.260
Kitami-san asked me to tell you that the car is ready.

00:18:27.520 --> 00:18:31.260
Ok, I can get over there during my lunch break.

00:18:31.470 --> 00:18:34.270
I'll hang around and give you a ride there.

00:18:37.810 --> 00:18:41.770
Can the engine of a Z31 reach 300?

00:18:42.050 --> 00:18:42.910
Eh?

00:18:42.910 --> 00:18:46.840
That's what I went to ask Kitami-san.

00:18:46.840 --> 00:18:49.780
He said you are more familiar with it.

00:18:50.100 --> 00:18:55.740
A Z31 is a single turbo VG30, right?

00:18:55.740 --> 00:18:56.540
Yeah.

00:18:56.750 --> 00:19:01.550
Well, a VG could reach 300 running on Yatabe.

00:19:01.550 --> 00:19:05.210
But that'd be only if it had a one-try setting,

00:19:05.210 --> 00:19:08.670
kinda like an extreme boost that you'd only use to end a battle.

00:19:08.670 --> 00:19:09.810
I see.

00:19:09.810 --> 00:19:15.060
On the straight, especially on Wangan, you accelerate lots of times,

00:19:15.420 --> 00:19:19.080
you need to keep the revs really high but in terms of a race...

00:19:20.290 --> 00:19:21.560
<i>Could it be...</i>

00:19:21.560 --> 00:19:27.470
A Z31 could've taken me easily while I was cruising at 260.

00:19:27.470 --> 00:19:31.560
The Z's speed stayed at around 280.

00:19:32.490 --> 00:19:37.870
<i>It must be Harada. He got his Z31 up to that kind of power.</i>

00:19:38.820 --> 00:19:40.870
Looks like you know who I mean.

00:19:47.370 --> 00:19:49.630
Goodbye then.

00:19:49.630 --> 00:19:51.470
Oh, thank you.

00:19:55.360 --> 00:19:57.490
So, is the car ready?

00:19:58.600 --> 00:20:00.250
You can give it a try.

00:20:03.390 --> 00:20:05.330
By the way, did you buy it?

00:20:05.330 --> 00:20:06.470
Eh?

00:20:06.470 --> 00:20:08.390
That GT-R.

00:20:08.720 --> 00:20:09.550
Yeah.

00:20:09.550 --> 00:20:12.500
Really? That's good to know.

00:20:17.500 --> 00:20:20.450
<i>Why do I have this feeling?</i>

00:20:21.600 --> 00:20:26.260
<i>Can I compete with him... against the strongest car he built?</i>

00:20:27.030 --> 00:20:28.630
<i>The Devil Z.</i>

00:20:42.530 --> 00:20:43.860
No work today?

00:20:43.860 --> 00:20:47.800
I've got the day off. I miss the Wangan.

00:20:47.800 --> 00:20:49.470
Really? I knew it.

00:20:52.100 --> 00:20:53.260
It feels good.

00:20:53.260 --> 00:20:54.340
I know, right?

00:20:54.340 --> 00:20:56.560
The R is still the best.

00:21:11.330 --> 00:21:15.000
Are you thinking about the Z?

00:21:15.700 --> 00:21:17.850
There's something I'd like to know.

00:21:17.850 --> 00:21:18.800
What is it?

00:21:18.810 --> 00:21:23.100
Do you think that the Z will forgive me?

00:21:24.020 --> 00:21:26.050
That time I couldn't save it.

00:21:27.950 --> 00:21:31.200
Let me take you to the Z.

00:21:31.200 --> 00:21:31.840
Huh?

00:21:32.190 --> 00:21:33.860
See it with your own eyes.

00:21:37.190 --> 00:21:41.990
He wants the car mainly for loop and hill roads.

00:21:41.990 --> 00:21:45.150
Ok, ok... that's easy.

00:21:45.150 --> 00:21:47.590
How many more can you get me?

00:21:47.590 --> 00:21:48.830
There are just two for now.

00:21:49.800 --> 00:21:52.940
I'm counting on you... I really need this money coming in.

00:21:52.940 --> 00:21:57.100
Speaking of which, you haven't started on it yet.

00:21:57.100 --> 00:21:58.380
How come?

00:21:59.390 --> 00:22:02.630
I really need to be in the right frame of mind for this one.

00:22:07.140 --> 00:22:11.150
<i>The Z flinched... I just heard it.</i>

00:22:15.670 --> 00:22:16.880
Akio...

00:22:17.150 --> 00:22:25.150
<i>Is this really him? The driver of the legendary Devil Z?</i>

00:22:25.150 --> 00:22:27.210
<i>That guy?!</i>

00:22:27.210 --> 00:22:28.190
Where's Z?

00:22:30.520 --> 00:22:31.860
It's right here.

00:22:35.610 --> 00:22:36.590
Z...

00:22:48.680 --> 00:22:56.150
